## Limitations

- Node matching is heuristic \(family, relation or object, parent relationship, child order\)\. EXPLAIN output carries no node identity, so a pair may not be the same executor node; each finding lists the match confidence and reason\.
- Actual times come from single EXPLAIN ANALYZE runs and include instrumentation overhead; repeat the runs before drawing conclusions from time differences\.
- QueryLens does not recommend indexes or schema changes; findings only describe how the two plans differ\.
- A plan difference does not by itself explain an HTTP or application latency regression; confirm with measurements of the affected requests\.
